    "totalDuration": "9 yrs 6 mos",
    "description": "• HW bring up\n- Deep understanding of HW signals and schematic and how to use oscilloscope and logic analyzer to help trouble shooting new HW and Chip.\n- I2C, SPI protocols.\n- Ethernet IP bring up.\n- I2S, SPDIF handling.\n- Composite/Component/Baseband video signal verification.\n\n\n• Video encoder\n- Understand video encoder flow\n- VBV management with rate controller\n- GOP controller\n- Mpeg2 and H264\n- Closed caption and other ancillary data.\n\n• Global rate control\n- Manage statistic information from each encoder.\n- Robustness handling in case of link failure.\n\n• Multi-core programming\n- Cache management\n- Data transfer between cores\n- Load balancing\n\n• Video pre-processing. \n- Scaler.\n- DeInterlacer\n- Inverse telecine \n- Frame rate control\n\n• Base band Video input/output device driver.\n- Base band video signals for each video standard.\n- VANC (DTVCC, ADF and so on)\n- NTSC, PAL signals along with specific data such as closed caption and WSS.\n\n• HDMI Rx/Tx device driver.\n- HDMI handshaking steps.\n- EDID\n- HDCP\n\n• Ethernet device driver.\n\n• DVB set top box development\n- GUI development on RTOS\n- Field test from various Europe countries.\n- Knowledge of DVB signals along with teletext, EPG and so on.\n\n• Main languages are C and C++",
